      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it intended that a device reporting a newer version than the stored one now fails to mount? The bundled openconfig-interfaces is 2.5.0, so a device reporting 3.x or even 2.6.0 lands here and the whole mount fails, where before the single stored copy was used with a WARN. If intended, could we add a release note naming the workarounds (upload the device\u0027s versions, or force versionless capabilities), or keep the old fallback behind an opt-in flag?",
